## Additional Vulnerable Classes Found

### 1. JavaScriptTieredBrokerSelectorStrategy
**Full Path:** `/root/druid/server/src/main/java/org/apache/druid/server/router/JavaScriptTieredBrokerSelectorStrategy.java`

**Constructor Code (lines 48-58):**
